entries[1261558] = { ["name"] = "Lightscar Flare", ["text"] = "60 yd range\nInstant\nA fractured image of Lothraxion strikes at Nysarra, causing her wound to flare and stunning her for 18 sec. Players caught in the image's blast suffer 145399 Holy damage and are disoriented for 5 sec.\n\nStanding in the wound's flare increases the target's healing done by 30% and damage dealt to Nysarra by 300% but inflicts 67888 Holy damage every 1 sec until she recovers." }
