entries[1261867] = { ["name"] = "Heart of the Wild", ["text"] = "40 yd range\nInstant 2 min cooldown\nRestoration\nPerform a powerful off-role ability depending on your currently active shapeshift form.\n\nBalance, Feral\nPerform a powerful off-role ability depending on your currently active shapeshift form.\n\nNon-shapeshifted:\nEmpowered Wild Growth that heals up to 5 injured allies within 30 yards of the target for [(336.7% of Spell Power) * 750 / 100] over 7 sec.\n\nGuardian\nPerform a powerful off-role ability depending on your currently active shapeshift form.\n\nNon-shapeshifted:\nEmpowered Wild Growth that heals up to 5 injured allies within 30 yards of the target for [(336.7% of Spell Power) * 750 / 100] over 7 sec.\n\nCat Form:\nUnleash an empowered Feral Frenzy, clawing your target 5 times for [5 * (16.3% of Attack Power) * 1000 / 100] Physical damage and an additional [5 * 1000 / 100 * (32.67% of Attack Power) * 6 / 2] Bleed damage over 6 sec. Awards 5 combo points.\n\nMoonkin Form:\nCall down waves of empowered falling stars upon enemies within 40 yds, dealing [54 * (27% of Spell Power)] Astral damage over 8 sec." }
entries[1261868] = { ["name"] = "Heart of the Wild", ["text"] = "8 yd range\nInstant 2 min cooldown\nPerform a powerful off-role ability depending on your currently active shapeshift form.\n\nBalance, Feral, Guardian\nNon-shapeshifted:\nEmpowered Wild Growth that heals up to 5 injured allies within 30 yards of the target for [(336.7% of Spell Power) * 750 / 100] over 7 sec\n\nGuardian\nCat Form:\nUnleash an empowered Feral Frenzy, clawing your target 5 times for [5 * (16.3% of Attack Power) * 1000 / 100] Physical damage and an additional [5 * 1000 / 100 * (32.67% of Attack Power) * 6 / 2] Bleed damage over 6 sec. Awards 5 combo points.\n\nMoonkin Form:\nCall down waves of empowered falling stars upon enemies within 40 yds, dealing [54 * (27% of Spell Power)] Astral damage over 8 sec\n\nBear Form:\nIncrease your maximum health by 30% for 20 sec." }
